558
00:45:16,334 --> 00:45:18,314
[SPEAKER_02]: I've done this one retreat and it happened to me.

559
00:45:19,578 --> 00:45:22,260
[SPEAKER_02]: You most likely know they don't know what they're talking about.

560
00:45:23,461 --> 00:45:25,603
[SPEAKER_02]: Because it doesn't happen to you, you develop it.

561
00:45:25,663 --> 00:45:33,349
[SPEAKER_02]: And if there's some... if something you develop, if there is something that you developed, you will know how you developed.

562
00:45:34,430 --> 00:45:36,472
[SPEAKER_02]: Thus, Sotāpanna knows that he knows.

563
00:45:37,172 --> 00:45:38,994
[SPEAKER_02]: He's not just like, oh, yeah, it happened to me.

564
00:45:39,034 --> 00:45:41,696
[SPEAKER_02]: I don't know how, I can't put it into words, but it happened.

565
00:45:42,236 --> 00:45:43,277
[SPEAKER_02]: That's lots of nonsense.

566
00:45:44,518 --> 00:45:46,100
[SPEAKER_02]: That's a spiritual mystical talk.

567
00:45:46,865 --> 00:45:59,910
[SPEAKER_02]: But if you've done something for thousands of times internally, and then you start to... then you have to confirm for yourself that it works, that it's freeing you from suffering directly here and now, then you will know that.

568
00:46:00,670 --> 00:46:12,475
