569
00:46:27,166 --> 00:46:31,870
[SPEAKER_02]: So, that's why the utterance of another is one of the two factors for the right view.

570
00:46:32,450 --> 00:46:33,832
[SPEAKER_02]: The other one is proper attention.

571
00:46:33,932 --> 00:46:39,836
[SPEAKER_02]: So, you got the utterance and then you keep properly attending it on and on and on and on.

572
00:46:41,418 --> 00:46:46,202
[SPEAKER_02]: But if you don't have proper attention, you can have all the right utterance of other people all the time.

573
00:46:47,062 --> 00:46:48,223
[SPEAKER_02]: As you know, sometimes people did.

574
00:46:48,283 --> 00:46:53,908
[SPEAKER_02]: They lived with... near the Buddha all the time, but never became anything, because they never properly attended.

575
00:46:58,268 --> 00:46:59,048
[SPEAKER_00]: Proper attention.

576
00:47:00,549 --> 00:47:03,549
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, proper attention is all this what we've been talking about.

577
00:47:03,569 --> 00:47:03,809
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

578
00:47:03,929 --> 00:47:04,829
[SPEAKER_02]: Proper intention.

579
00:47:11,931 --> 00:47:12,831
[SPEAKER_02]: But that's another thing.

580
00:47:12,951 --> 00:47:21,853
