587
00:47:52,887 --> 00:47:55,950
[SPEAKER_02]: And then, each time, you know, he grips it, he's wearing it down.

588
00:47:57,798 --> 00:48:03,382
[SPEAKER_02]: But you can't look at it and say, ah, today I wore down my handle this much or that much.

589
00:48:03,783 --> 00:48:10,368
[SPEAKER_02]: Only after, you know, years of using it, one day you look and, oh, it's really thin.

590
00:48:10,548 --> 00:48:12,290
[SPEAKER_02]: I really wore this handle down.

591
00:48:13,390 --> 00:48:15,552
[SPEAKER_02]: And that's how ignorance is being removed.

592
00:48:15,592 --> 00:48:18,234
[SPEAKER_02]: It's the same sense, same feeling.

