612
00:49:57,780 --> 00:50:00,040
[SPEAKER_02]: Trying to understand can lead to understand.

613
00:50:01,521 --> 00:50:07,382
[SPEAKER_02]: But one thing for sure, you can't understand something accidentally, without making an effort.

